WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:09.000
Enterprise knowledge becomes stale, conflicts, and changes.
I built ContextLab to test when added AI complexity is justified.

00:09.000 --> 00:18.000
I froze the corpus, tasks, budgets, provider envelope, and promotion gates.
Protected evaluation truth stays outside the system under test.

00:18.000 --> 00:27.000
The G2 retrieval gate retained R0.
The G3 temporal-memory gate promoted no memory policy.

00:27.000 --> 00:36.000
F3 paging and F5 bounded search were accepted as negative demonstrations.
More machinery did not earn a promotion.

00:36.000 --> 00:44.000
At first, the active NovaLearn sales audience is midmarket teams.

00:44.000 --> 00:54.000
A later, higher-authority event changes the active audience to regulated enterprises.
The earlier claim stays visible as superseded.

00:54.000 --> 01:04.000
Each public run keeps its context, generation, citations, review, and gate decision bound to evidence.

01:04.000 --> 01:15.000
I conceived and own ContextLab. Agents did bounded implementation and review work.
I audited the evidence and made every final human decision.
